1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,720
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Gabby turned on the weather channel.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:06,480
It was going to be 45 degrees Fahrenheit.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,500
What a cold day for California.

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,020
Gabby had to prepare.

5
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,920
She found a jacket with fur.

6
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:17,940
She hasn't worn it since December.

7
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:21,240
She put her gloves on her hands.

8
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,740
Her grandmother knitted them for her.

9
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,960
She put on two layers of pants.

10
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,320
She wrapped a scarf around her neck.

11
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:33,740
Her grandmother knitted that for her, too.

12
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,800
She put a hat on her head.

13
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:39,860
She put on her fuzzy socks.

14
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,540
She put on her boots.

15
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,680
She was ready to go.

16
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:48,180
She stepped outside.

17
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:52,700
She saw people wearing shorts and tank tops.
